It depends (of course) on what interests you.  You can certainly (as
you've shown) ascend without any spells but as David pointed out, at a
minimum, try to learn one spell so that you can forget it later.  Any
other spells are just gravy.  When I'm playing a combat role, I'll
read every book that I find (in a safe place) and if it crumbles then
"so what?" I wouldn't have been able to cast it anyway, but maybe
it'll be something convenient.
