> during altar camping to move them to uncursed.
>
> The special spell for a valk is cone of cold. =A0This matters a lot
> on levels like Medusa where you can just blast a path to where
> you want to go. =A0Run out of power? =A0Go explore a bit and come
> back later.
>
While it's convenient to have this trick in one's repertoire, as one
who has "drowned in a pool (with the Amulet" I'd recommend against
relying on it.  It also takes a bunch of reading to find a spellbook
of cone of cold whereas wands of cold are in much greater supply.  In
the absence of other safer means of crossing water, it's fine, but
head for land if you see a red D, or a red N, or any hostile who might
be inclined to zap you with a wand of fire.

Congratulations on your ascension!

